  <entry>
    <title>Java学习(一)</title>
    <link href="https://frolen88.github.io/2025/01/07/inheritance/"/>
    <id>https://frolen88.github.io/2025/01/07/inheritance/</id>
    <published>2025-01-07T11:29:46.000Z</published>
    <updated>2025-01-07T12:28:01.871Z</updated>
    
    <content type="html"><![CDATA[<h2 id="继承"><a href="#继承" class="headerlink" title="继承"></a>继承</h2><p>​    <strong>原因</strong>：从接触Java依赖，封装、继承、多态三大特性已经接触过多次。但每过一段时间都会有遗忘，因此对此进行记录与总结，并给出对应的代码示例，便于下次进行复习。</p><h3 id="构造方法"><a href="#构造方法" class="headerlink" title="构造方法"></a>构造方法</h3><p>​    切记，Java中的继承，<strong>子类并不会继承父类的构造方法</strong>。构造方法一般都是在实例化的时候使用，且与类名相同。<strong>根据Java中的限制，子类和父类必不可能具有完全相同的类名。</strong><a href="https://github.com/frolen88/JavaCoding/blob/d4a26248aef4527ecf62f65b5156e6799d397315/src/test_extend/TestConstructor.java">代码链接</a></p><figure class="highlight java"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="keyword">public</span> <span class="keyword">class</span> <span class="title class_">TestConstructor</span> &#123;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">public</span> <span class="keyword">static</span> <span class="keyword">void</span> <span class="title function_">main</span><span class="params">(String[] args)</span> &#123;</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="type">SonC</span> <span class="variable">sonC</span> <span class="operator">=</span> <span class="keyword">new</span> <span class="title class_">SonC</span>();   <span class="comment">// correct</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment">//        SonC son2 = new SonC(3); // &#x27;Son()&#x27; cannot be applied to &#x27;(int)&#x27;</span></span><br><span class="line">    &#125;</span><br><span class="line">&#125;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">class</span> <span class="title class_">FatherC</span>&#123;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="type">int</span> x;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">public</span> <span class="title function_">FatherC</span><span class="params">()</span> &#123;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">    &#125;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">public</span> <span class="title function_">FatherC</span><span class="params">(<span class="type">int</span> x)</span> &#123;</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="built_in">this</span>.x = x;</span><br><span class="line">    &#125;</span><br><span class="line">&#125;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">class</span> <span class="title class_">SonC</span> <span class="keyword">extends</span> <span class="title class_">FatherC</span>&#123;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="comment">// JVM在这里自动创建了一个空参构造方法</span></span><br><span class="line">&#125;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><hr><h3 id="成员变量"><a href="#成员变量" class="headerlink" title="成员变量"></a>成员变量</h3><p>​    Java中的<strong>子类会继承父类所有的成员变量</strong>，但并不是全部都能够进行访问。具体的情况如下。在图一中，我们可以很清晰的看到其中包含了private的成员变量值。<a href="https://github.com/frolen88/JavaCoding/blob/1bbba8ffd871ae6dabb681a3f9f47d69050a1c19/src/test_extend/TestMemberVariable.java">代码链接</a></p><p><img src="\pic\memberVariable.png" alt="图一：成员变量信息(黑马程序员B站课程截图(BV17F411T7Ao))"></p><figure class="highlight java"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="keyword">public</span> <span class="keyword">class</span> <span class="title class_">TestMemberVariable</span> &#123;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">public</span> <span class="keyword">static</span> <span class="keyword">void</span> <span class="title function_">main</span><span class="params">(String[] args)</span> &#123;</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="type">SonMV</span> <span class="variable">sonMV</span> <span class="operator">=</span> <span class="keyword">new</span> <span class="title class_">SonMV</span>();</span><br><span class="line">        System.out.println(sonMV.y);</span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment">//        System.out.println(sonMV.x); //&#x27;x&#x27; has private access in &#x27;test_extend.FatherMV&#x27;</span></span><br><span class="line">    &#125;</span><br><span class="line">&#125;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">class</span> <span class="title class_">FatherMV</span>&#123;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">private</span> <span class="type">int</span> <span class="variable">x</span> <span class="operator">=</span> <span class="number">1</span>;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="type">int</span> <span class="variable">y</span> <span class="operator">=</span> <span class="number">2</span>;</span><br><span class="line">&#125;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">class</span> <span class="title class_">SonMV</span> <span class="keyword">extends</span> <span class="title class_">FatherMV</span>&#123;</span><br><span class="line">&#125;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><hr><h3 id="成员方法"><a href="#成员方法" class="headerlink" title="成员方法"></a>成员方法</h3><p>​    Java中的子类会继承父类中的虚方法，主要依赖虚方法表。虚方法表中包含父类中非private，非static，非final的方法。具体的情况可以如图二所示，需要注意的是，Object类中存在五个可以填在虚方法表中的方法。<a href="https://github.com/frolen88/JavaCoding/blob/1bbba8ffd871ae6dabb681a3f9f47d69050a1c19/src/test_extend/TestMemberFunction.java">代码链接</a></p><p><a href="\pic\memberFunction.png">图二：成员函数信息(黑马程序员B站课程截图(BV17F411T7Ao))</a></p><figure class="highlight java"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="keyword">public</span> <span class="keyword">class</span> <span class="title class_">TestMemberFunction</span> &#123;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">public</span> <span class="keyword">static</span> <span class="keyword">void</span> <span class="title function_">main</span><span class="params">(String[] args)</span> &#123;</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="type">SonMF</span> <span class="variable">sonMF</span> <span class="operator">=</span> <span class="keyword">new</span> <span class="title class_">SonMF</span>();</span><br><span class="line">        sonMF.function1(); <span class="comment">// 子类可以调用父类中的static方法，但是并不是继承下来的</span></span><br><span class="line">        sonMF.function2(); <span class="comment">// public 显然可以继承</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment">//        sonMF.function3(); // &#x27;function3()&#x27; has private access in &#x27;test_extend.FatherMF&#x27;</span></span><br><span class="line">        sonMF.function4(); <span class="comment">// 可以调用，只是无法重写</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">    &#125;</span><br><span class="line">&#125;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">class</span> <span class="title class_">FatherMF</span>&#123;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">public</span> <span class="keyword">static</span> <span class="keyword">void</span> <span class="title function_">function1</span><span class="params">()</span>&#123;</span><br><span class="line">        System.out.println(<span class="string">&quot;function1&quot;</span>);</span><br><span class="line">    &#125;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">public</span> <span class="keyword">void</span> <span class="title function_">function2</span><span class="params">()</span>&#123;</span><br><span class="line">        System.out.println(<span class="string">&quot;function2&quot;</span>);</span><br><span class="line">    &#125;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">private</span> <span class="keyword">void</span> <span class="title function_">function3</span><span class="params">()</span>&#123;</span><br><span class="line">        System.out.println(<span class="string">&quot;function3&quot;</span>);</span><br><span class="line">    &#125;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">final</span> <span class="keyword">public</span> <span class="keyword">void</span> <span class="title function_">function4</span><span class="params">()</span>&#123;</span><br><span class="line">        System.out.println(<span class="string">&quot;function4&quot;</span>);</span><br><span class="line">    &#125;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">&#125;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">class</span> <span class="title class_">SonMF</span> <span class="keyword">extends</span> <span class="title class_">FatherMF</span>&#123;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">&#125;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>]]></content>
    
    
    <summary type="html">Java学习。与继承相关的一些知识。</summary>
    
    
    
